$$ \, solid-state \, (magnetic)\, dipolar = -ssd; \, Superconductivity = \, -spc;$$

$$ \, Semiconductors \,= \,-smc ; = \,Electrons \,in\, solids \, = \, es.$$

  $$FMyr = Fields \, Medal \, + \, year$$
